**{{ artifact.name }}** is a **{{ gguf.total_bytes | gib }} GiB** GGUF quantization of [`{{ base.repo }}`](https://huggingface.co/{{ base.repo }}) (`{{ base.revision | short }}`) compressed from **{{ artifact.n_routed_base | int }} to {{ artifact.n_routed | int }} routed experts per decoder layer** using **HOPE** (pairwise co-activation with REAP-sum diagonal) and **GPTQ error-feedback K-quantization (`{{ gguf.bpw | f2 }}` bpw)**, while keeping all attention, indexer, compressor, shared-expert, token-embedding, and `lm_head` tensors at **`Q8_0` (`F32` norms/router/hyper-connections)**.

---

## ✨ Highlights

- **{{ artifact.n_routed | int }}/{{ artifact.n_routed_base | int }} Routed-Expert Pruning with HOPE + Drift Guards:** Retains **{{ artifact.n_routed | int }} of {{ artifact.n_routed_base | int }} routed experts** per decoder layer (`keep-set {{ gguf.keepset_sha256 | short }}`), protecting Super-Experts, attention-sink experts, and multimodal (`bias_vl`) experts across a 4.98M-token 9-domain calibration corpus.
- **Folded Per-Layer Output-Gain Healing:** Folds the calibrated per-layer post-pruning variance-restoration scalar directly into each surviving expert's `w2` (`down_proj`) projection prior to GPTQ error-feedback quantization (`Q2_K` / `Q3_K` / `Q4_K`).
- **Uncompromised `Q8_0` / `F32` Dense & Attention Path:** Preserves Multi-head Latent Attention (MLA), Dynamic Sparse Attention (DSA) indexer, KV compressor, shared experts, token embeddings, and `lm_head` at `Q8_0`, with RMSNorms, router gates (`gate.weight`, `gate.bias`, `gate.bias_vl`), and mHC Sinkhorn hyper-connections in `F32`.
- **Verified Teacher-Forced Fidelity:** Achieves **96.9% top-1 agreement (`kl32 = 0.061`) on code**, **92.9% (`kl32 = 0.151`) on math**, **86.5% (`kl32 = 0.366`) on vision**, and **84.6% (`kl32 = 0.227`) on agentic tasks** against the unpruned teacher across {{ s10.tokens_scored | int }} held-out confirmation tokens.

