## What is in this repository

- **`{{ gguf.filename }}`** ({{ gguf.total_bytes | gib }} GiB, sha256 `{{ gguf.sha256 }}`).
  - Routed experts (`blk.*.ffn_*_exps.weight`, {{ artifact.n_routed | int }} experts per layer): mixed K-quants (`Q2_K`, `Q3_K`, `Q4_K`), **{{ gguf.bpw | f2 }} bits per weight** on average, quantized once from the MXFP4 source with GPTQ error-feedback rounding (`ops/s07_quant.py`). The per-layer heal gain was folded into `w2` before rounding.
  - Dense path (attention, indexer, compressor, shared expert, token embedding, `lm_head`): `Q8_0` (from the base checkpoint's FP8/BF16 tensors).
  - Norms, router (`gate.weight`, `gate.bias`, `gate.bias_vl`), hyper-connection scalars and projections: `F32`.
  - Vision tower and aligner: included in `BF16` (`v.*` tensors), unpruned.
  - DSpark / MTP speculative-decoding layers (`mtp.0`, `mtp.1`, `mtp.2`): included (`Q8_0` dense + `F32` norms).
- **`reap_keepset.json`** (sha256 `{{ gguf.keepset_sha256 }}`): the kept expert ids per layer.

---

## The keep-set

- **Calibration corpus:** 4,975,198 tokens in 8k sequences plus a 32k–128k long-context pool, balanced across general, multilingual, agentic, code, vision, math, science, finance, and long-context text (`corpus_spec` `c1803e70af7db162`), run layer-by-layer through the teacher with Engram enabled.
- **Expert ranking & protection:** Candidate keep-sets were ranked by **HOPE** (pairwise co-activation with the REAP-sum diagonal; [arXiv:2609.18916](https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.18916)), REAP-sum ([arXiv:2510.13999](https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.13999)), routing mass, frequency, and random anchors.
  - Each domain pool — and image tokens ranked separately under `gate.bias_vl` — protected its top specialist experts at the measured protect-fraction knee (`0.06`).
  - Super-Experts and position-sensitive / attention-sink experts were locked against pruning (long-context drift guard).
- **Held-out KL arbitration:** Arbitrated by held-out teacher top-32 KL on the screening split (`winner: hope_sum_pf0`, keep-set sha256 `{{ gguf.keepset_sha256 }}`).

